# Build artefacts -- regenerated from source on every `make`.
obj/
kernel.elf
*.o
*.d

# Live boot capture from runlog.ps1.
live.log

# Serial log written by tools/run.ps1 (mirror of COM1 from the kernel
# tty); the assistant tails this file instead of asking for screenshots.
#
# The glob, not just the default name: run.ps1 takes -LogFile, and a session
# comparing two images or a good boot against a deliberately broken one names
# them serial-apfs.log, serial-fat.log, serial-break.log and so on.  Those
# escaped a rule that matched only "serial.log" and were committed by
# `git add -A` three times before anyone noticed.
serial*.log

# Screendumps and other ad-hoc debug artefacts.
*.png
*.ppm
*.bmp

# Editor scratch.
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# Disk images used for ATA driver smoke tests.
disk.img
*.img

# Browser-render of mdoc man pages (regenerated via mandoc -Thtml).
docs/man/*.html
